              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KeeGee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Followed the recipe for my first try except I skipped the frosting since it seemed sweet enough as is. Very tasty. The given time was a bit much for my oven so it ended up with a crust a bit too crunchy. I expect a few minutes less would make it perfect.",
